Description: Future Task Manager CLI - Terminal System Performance Monitor
 Conceived by Paulo Roberto Jentsch (Future Technology Informatica).
 Lightweight C++ and ncursesw terminal monitor featuring Braille graphs for CPU,
 logical processors, memory, disks, partitions, network, USB hot-plug,
 Linux distribution and kernel version.
